<!-- ================= OUR FOUNDER SECTION ================= -->
<section class="relative bg-[#faf9f6] py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden">
  
  <!-- Desktop / Large Screen Background Image (Bishop on the right side) -->
  <div 
    class="hidden lg:block absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-right bg-no-repeat"
    style="background-image: url('images/Dignified Bishop with Golden Crozier.png'); background-position: right center;"
    data-aos="fade-left"
    data-aos-duration="1000"
  ></div>

  <!-- Soft White Gradient Overlay (Protects text readability and blends cleanly into the image) -->
  <div class="hidden lg:block absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-white/80 via-45% to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10">
    
    <!-- Mobile & Tablet Image Container (Displays neatly on top for small screens) -->
    <div class="lg:hidden relative mb-8 sm:mb-10 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md" data-aos="fade-down" data-aos-duration="800">
      <img
        src="images/Dignified Bishop with Golden Crozier.png"
        alt="His Grace Dr. Abraham Mor Severious Metropolitan"
        class="w-full h-72 sm:h-96 md:h-[460px] object-cover object-right"
      />
      <!-- Heading overlaid on the light left side of the image (mobile & tablet) -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-white/85 via-white/50 via-45% to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-[58%] sm:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-center pl-4 sm:pl-8 pr-2">
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
          OUR <span class="text-sky">FOUNDER</span>
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-1 font-cormorant text-lg sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-navy leading-[1.2]">
          His Grace Dr. Abraham Mor Severious Metropolitan
        </h2>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Content Column: Constrained to lg:col-span-6 so text NEVER touches the black dress -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 xl:col-span-6 z-10 max-w-xl" data-aos="fade-right" data-aos-duration="900" data-aos-delay="200">
        
        <!-- Tagline / Subtitle -->
       
<p class="hidden lg:block text-base sm:text-lg font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
          OUR <span class="text-sky">FOUNDER</span>
        </p>
        <!-- Main Title (desktop only; mobile/tablet shows it on the image above) -->
        <h2 class="hidden lg:block font-cormorant text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[40px] font-bold text-navy leading-[1.2] mb-6">
          His Grace Dr. Abraham<br />
          Mor Severious Metropolitan
        </h2>

        <!-- Description Paragraphs matching the exact line splits and font styling -->
        <div class="font-lato space-y-4 text-[#1E1E1E]/90 text-sm md:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            His Grace Dr. Abraham Mor Severious Metropolitan was born on July 12, 1941, in Peechanikkad near Angamaly, Kerala.
          </p>

          <p>
            During his early priesthood at Thrikkunnathu Seminary, he frequently visited nearby government hospitals where he encountered the suffering of the poorest and most neglected members of society. These experiences planted the seeds for what later became Guardian Angel Care Charitable Society.
          </p>

          <p>
            Following theological studies in Russia, Sweden, England, and the United States, he was ordained Metropolitan on March 6, 1982. His vision for compassionate service took organized form through the establishment of the Society in 1985.
          </p>

          <p>
            Under his spiritual leadership, the Society grew into a network of humanitarian institutions dedicated to healthcare, education, rehabilitation, and social transformation.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
<!-- ================= OUR EVOLUTION SECTION ================= -->
<section 
  class="relative bg-[#fcfbf7] bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 overflow-hidden"
  style="background-image: url('images/Elegant Cream Waves with Botanical Accents.png');"
>
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10">
    
    <!-- Top Heading & Intro Text -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="800">
      
      <!-- Section Title -->
      <h2 class="font-cormorant text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[40px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy leading-tight mb-4">
        Our Evolution
      </h2>

      <!-- Description Paragraphs -->
      <div class="font-lato space-y-3.5 text-[#1E1E1E]/90 text-sm md:text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          Guardian Angel Care Charitable Society began as a small charitable initiative inspired by compassion for the poor and suffering. Over nearly four decades, the Society has expanded into a multifaceted humanitarian organization serving thousands of individuals across Kerala.
        </p>

        <p>
          What began with prayer, spiritual preparation, and a dream of service has today become a trusted institution engaged in:
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- 7 Services / Pillars Grid with Dividers -->
    <div 
